            },
            "description": "Successful response"
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "Summary"
        ],
        "summary": "The whole app state as one markdown digest, meant for an LLM to read.",
        "description": "Budget and wealth in a single document, with the caveats a model would\notherwise get wrong: the budget-vs-snapshot date skew, settled occurrences\nbeing excluded from period totals, a card charged once rather than every\nperiod, and linear goal math against compounding FIRE math.\n\nComposes the same payloads GET /api/budget/current, /api/goals/roadmap,\n/api/goals/progress, /api/networth and /api/forecasting/projection return,\nso it can never disagree with them."
      }
    },
